+     *
+     * <p>The previous value (262144) was appropriate only for a synthetic global batch. Sensors operate on a
+     * per-mob snapshot, so that value effectively disabled the feature on every real server. 256 keeps the
+     * synchronous path for ordinary small scans while allowing dense farms to use the already bounded pool.</p>
+     */
+    private static final int AI_TARGET_SEARCH_PROFITABLE_FLOOR = 256;
